This is a collection of objects, scripts, and images for Lightwave
3.0.  Everything here is done by me, Alan Mackey.  To contact me
send email to MACKEY@ENIGMA.RIDER.EDU or write to me at PO BOX 475,
Wayne PA 19087, USA.  Some scripts use the default objects that came
with lightwave, like space/randomstars, space/planet, etc.  Here's a
list of what all these files do:

  SPACE OBJECTS
AS1-  Al's Ship 1..  A tiny ship, tanish, cool blue window, sleek.
      Fun thing to blow up.
AS2-  Al's Ship 2..  Another tiny ship, shiny grey, fighter.  Fun
      thing to blow stuff up with.
enginefire-  Parent this to a ship and position behind engine for
      fun effects.
lazer-  A simple white lazer.
Station1-  a big dark blue space station with lots of windows and
      creepy twisty towers.
thing-  A big space creature, put bones in it and move'em around and
      make it attack things, it's fun.
WeirdCone-  A thing you could use as an engine flare or some sort of
      vaporizing beam.  Bright cyan.

  LANDSCAPE OBJECTS
MountainCircle2-  a small chunk of land with mountains on it.
CloudCover-  designed to fit over MountainCircle2.
sky2-  alternate sky with distance dissolve.

  IMAGES
UDgradient.b-  image used in enginefire.

  StationChase-  A ship gets launched out of a space station and
      gets blown up.
  NastyStation-  Station attacks Planet. cool.
  PassMountains-  Some aircraft fly over moutntains.
  ThingKills-  A WORK OF ART.  Short but awesome.  The space thing
      devours a planet.

  Sorry about the carless orginization of this archive and bad
spelling in this textfile..  this was put together in kind of a
hurry for no reason at all.
                                        -Al
